<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sv">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Birdy – en enkel och stilren webbdemo.">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f8f4">
  <title>Birdy — Webben, enklare</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --background: #f7f8f4;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --ink: #17231d;
      --muted: #748078;
      --green: #24583f;
      --green-dark: #193f2e;
      --mint: #e3efe5;
      --line: #e8ebe5;
      --shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(27, 55, 37, .09);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 82% 18%, rgba(222, 237, 220, .65), transparent 31rem),
        var(--background);
      font: 16px/1.55 Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
    button, input { font: inherit; }
    .wrap { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin-inline: auto; }

    header {
      height: 82px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(31, 57, 39, .08);
    }

    .brand {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 11px;
      font-size: 19px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.04em;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      width: 38px;
      height: 38px;
      place-items: center;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 13px;
      background: var(--green);
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 5px 14px rgba(36, 88, 63, .22);
    }

    .brand-mark svg { width: 23px; height: 23px; }

    nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 30px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
    nav a:hover, footer a:hover { color: var(--green); }

    .nav-cta {
      padding: 10px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.7);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 650;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 610px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.08fr .92fr;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 62px;
      padding-block: 74px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 9px;
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 750;
      letter-spacing: .12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .eyebrow-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #79a987;
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(121, 169, 135, .15);
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 640px;
      margin: 20px 0 18px;
      font-size: clamp(48px, 7vw, 78px);
      line-height: .99;
      letter-spacing: -.075em;
    }

    h1 span { color: var(--green); }

    .hero-copy {
      max-width: 485px;
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .search-card {
      margin-top: 32px;
      padding: 7px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(35, 67, 45, .11);
      border-radius: 15px;
      background: var(--surface);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(27, 55, 37, .08);
    }

    .search-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; }

    .search-icon {
      display: grid;
      width: 48px;
      flex: 0 0 48px;
      place-items: center;
      color: #8a968e;
    }

    .search-icon svg { width: 19px; height: 19px; }

    .search-card input {
      width: 100%;
      min-width: 0;
      border: 0;
      outline: 0;
      color: var(--ink);
      background: transparent;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .search-card input::placeholder { color: #9aa39c; }

    .search-card button {
      display: inline-flex;
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      min-height: 50px;
      padding: 0 19px;
      border: 0;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--green);
      color: white;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background .2s, transform .2s;
    }

    .search-card button:hover {
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      background: var(--green-dark);
    }

    .search-card button svg { width: 16px; height: 16px; }

    .form-note {
      min-height: 24px;
      margin: 10px 4px 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .proof-points {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 18px;
      margin-top: 22px;
      color: #68776d;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .proof-points span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }
    .check { color: var(--green); font-weight: 800; }

    .visual {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 440px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
    }

    .visual-glow {
      position: absolute;
      width: 360px;
      height: 360px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: #e4eee1;
      filter: blur(1px);
    }

    .browser {
      position: relative;
      width: min(100%, 430px);
      padding: 13px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(35, 67, 45, .12);
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.88);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      transform: rotate(2deg);
    }

    .browser-top {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      height: 28px;
      padding: 0 4px 10px;
    }

    .browser-top i { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: #e1e6df; }
    .browser-top i:first-child { background: #e9b9ae; }
    .browser-top i:nth-child(2) { background: #e7d49b; }
    .browser-top i:nth-child(3) { background: #a9cdb0; }

    .browser-address {
      margin-left: auto;
      padding: 4px 11px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: #f5f7f3;
      color: #9aa39c;
      font-size: 10px;
    }

    .browser-content {
      min-height: 300px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 26px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 24%, rgba(218, 234, 215, .72), transparent 52%),
        #f8faf6;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .bird-art {
      display: grid;
      width: 76px;
      height: 76px;
      place-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 17px;
      border-radius: 26px;
      background: var(--green);
      color: white;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 25px rgba(36, 88, 63, .2);
    }

    .bird-art svg { width: 43px; height: 43px; }

    .browser-content h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 22px; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    .browser-content p { max-width: 255px; margin: 8px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }

    .floating-card {
      position: absolute;
      right: -12px;
      bottom: 32px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 14px 17px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(35, 67, 45, .09);
      border-radius: 13px;
      background: white;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 32px rgba(27, 55, 37, .1);
      transform: rotate(-3deg);
    }

    .floating-icon {
      display: grid;
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--mint);
      color: var(--green);
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .floating-card strong { display: block; font-size: 12px; }
    .floating-card small { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; }

    .shortcuts { padding: 22px 0 78px; }
    .shortcuts-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 18px; }
    .shortcuts-head h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 20px; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
    .shortcuts-head p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }

    .tile-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 14px; }

    .tile {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 13px;
      padding: 17px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.76);
      transition: transform .18s, border-color .18s, box-shadow .18s;
    }

    .tile:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      border-color: #c4d6c6;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(27, 55, 37, .06);
    }

    .tile-icon {
      display: grid;
      width: 40px;
      height: 40px;
      flex: 0 0 40px;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: var(--mint);
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .tile strong { display: block; font-size: 13px; }
    .tile small { color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; }

    .about {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 34px;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 78px;
      padding: 34px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: white;
    }

    .about h2 { margin: 10px 0; font-size: 28px; letter-spacing: -.055em; }
    .about p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }

    .about-badge {
      justify-self: end;
      max-width: 320px;
      padding: 19px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #f5f8f2;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
    }

    .about-badge strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; color: var(--ink); }

    footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; }
    .footer-row { min-height: 76px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 20px; }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; padding-top: 65px; }
      .hero-copy { max-width: 600px; }
      .visual { min-height: 390px; }
      .tile-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .about { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .about-badge { justify-self: start; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 540px) {
      .wrap { width: min(100% - 32px, 1120px); }
      header { height: 70px; }
      nav { gap: 14px; }
      nav a:first-child { display: none; }
      .nav-cta { padding: 8px 11px; }
      .hero { min-height: auto; padding: 58px 0 30px; }
      h1 { font-size: clamp(45px, 13vw, 62px); }
      .hero-copy { font-size: 16px; }
      .search-row { flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .search-icon { width: 36px; flex-basis: 36px; }
      .search-card input { width: calc(100% - 52px); }
      .search-card button { width: 100%; }
      .proof-points { gap: 10px 15px; }
      .visual { min-height: 340px; }
      .visual-glow { width: 280px; height: 280px; }
      .browser-content { min-height: 245px; }
      .floating-card { right: -3px; bottom: 12px; }
      .shortcuts { padding-bottom: 54px; }
      .shortcuts-head { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
      .tile-grid { gap: 10px; }
      .tile { padding: 12px; gap: 9px; }
      .tile-icon { width: 34px; height: 34px; flex-basis: 34px; }
      .about { margin-bottom: 52px; padding: 23px; }
      .footer-row { min-height: auto; padding: 20px 0; align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        transition-duration: .01ms !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="wrap">
    <a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="Birdy startsida">
      <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
          <path d="M20.2 4.5c-6.1.1-11.3 1.2-13.8 4.3-1.6 2-1.3 4.8.8 6.1 1.7 1.1 4.1.5 5.2-1.2l.5-.8c1.9-.3 4.5-2 5.7-4.1.8-1.4 1.3-2.9 1.6-4.3Z" fill="currentColor"/>
          <path d="M4.6 19.5c1.3-3.1 3.6-5.3 7.1-6.6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <circle cx="16.5" cy="7.5" r=".8" fill="#24583f"/>
        </svg>
      </span>
      Birdy
    </a>

    <nav aria-label="Huvudmeny">
      <a href="#genvagar">Genvägar</a>
      <a href="#om">Om Birdy</a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="mailto:hej@example.com">Kontakta oss</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero wrap">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> En enklare start på webben</div>
        <h1>Hitta din väg.<br><span>På ditt sätt.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-copy">
          En lugnare och tydligare startsida. Skriv en webbadress i rutan
          eller välj en av dina genvägar.
        </p>

        <form class="search-card" id="demo-form">
          <div class="search-row">
            <span class="search-icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none">
                <circle cx="10.8" cy="10.8" r="6.8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8"/>
                <path d="m16 16 4.2 4.2" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
            <input id="url" type="text" placeholder="Skriv en webbadress..." aria-label="Webbadress">
            <button type="submit">
              Fortsätt
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M4 10h11m-4-4 4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
              </svg>
            </button>
          </div>
          <p class="form-note" id="message" aria-live="polite">
            Detta är en visuell demo. Ingen proxyanslutning görs.
          </p>
        </form>

        <div class="proof-points">
          <span><b class="check">✓</b> Enkel design</span>
          <span><b class="check">✓</b> Fungerar på mobil</span>
          <span><b class="check">✓</b> Inget konto krävs för demon</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="visual" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="visual-glow"></div>
        <div class="browser">
          <div class="browser-top">
            <i></i><i></i><i></i>
            <span class="browser-address">birdy.example</span>
          </div>
          <div class="browser-content">
            <div class="bird-art">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none">
                <path d="M40 8c-12 .2-22.1 2.4-27 8.4-3.2 3.9-2.5 9.4 1.5 12 3.3 2.1 8 .9 10.2-2.4l1-1.6c3.7-.6 8.8-3.9 11.2-8 1.6-2.7 2.6-5.7 3.1-8.4Z" fill="currentColor"/>
                <path d="M9 38c2.6-6.1 7.1-10.4 14-13" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/>
                <circle cx="32.5" cy="14" r="1.7" fill="#24583f"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h2>Välkommen till Birdy</h2>
            <p>En enkel plats att börja när du surfar på webben.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="floating-card">
          <span class="floating-icon">✦</span>
          <span><strong>En sak i taget</strong><small>Rent. Tydligt. Enkelt.</small></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="shortcuts wrap" id="genvagar">
      <div class="shortcuts-head">
        <h2>Dina snabbgenvägar</h2>
        <p>Välj en sida att öppna i en ny flik.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="tile-grid">
        <a class="tile" href="https://www.wikipedia.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="tile-icon">W</span>
          <span><strong>Wikipedia</strong><small>Uppslagsverk</small></span>
        </a>
        <a class="tile" href="https://www.mozilla.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="tile-icon">M</span>
          <span><strong>Mozilla</strong><small>Öppen webb</small></span>
        </a>
        <a class="tile" href="https://developer.mozilla.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="tile-icon">&lt;/&gt;</span>
          <span><strong>MDN</strong><small>Webbutveckling</small></span>
        </a>
        <a class="tile" href="https://www.w3.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
          <span class="tile-icon">◎</span>
          <span><strong>W3C</strong><small>Webbstandarder</small></span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="about wrap" id="om">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Om projektet</div>
        <h2>Webben, utan onödigt krångel.</h2>
        <p>
          Birdy är en designmall för en enkel startsida. Anpassa text,
          färger och genvägar så att sidan passar ditt projekt.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="about-badge">
        <strong>En demo, inte en proxytjänst</strong>
        Adressfältet visar gränssnittet men skickar inte webbadresser vidare
        och hämtar inte innehåll från andra webbplatser.
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap footer-row">
      <span>© 2026 Birdy. Byt ut mot ditt eget namn.</span>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="#om">Om</a>
        <a href="mailto:hej@example.com">Kontakt</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document.getElementById("demo-form").addEventListener("submit", function (event) {
      event.preventDefault();

      const input = document.getElementById("url");
      const message = document.getElementById("message");

      if (!input.value.trim()) {
        message.textContent = "Skriv en webbadress för att testa formuläret.";
        input.focus();
        return;
      }

      message.textContent = "Det här är en frontend-demo — ingen proxyanslutning görs.";
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
